  "notes": [
    "VIN and VUSB are joined on the Teensy: cut the VUSB-VIN pads on its bottom before powering VIN while USB is plugged, or feed VIN through a diode/ideal-diode as here.",
    "Programming: the separate MKL02 bootloader chip (HalfKay) loads a .hex over USB with Teensy Loader / teensy_loader_cli; the program button forces it.",
    "The microSD socket (4-bit SDIO, BUILTIN_SDCARD) and the two QSPI PSRAM pads (APS6404L, 8 MB each; FlexSPI2) are on the module itself."
  ],
